From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Debayan Kar <kardebayan3@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:56:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drop MIUI backup agent

CameraBackupAgent extends miui.app.backup.FullBackupAgent, which only
exists in the MIUI framework. Any backup pass that binds the agent on a
non-MIUI system fails to load the class and kills the camera process.
Make it a plain BackupAgent with no-op backup and restore.
---
 smali/com/android/camera/backup/CameraBackupAgent.smali | 667 +++++++----------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 660 deletions(-)

